          </div>
          <span class="time" id="opsTime">10:47:21 AM</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ops-colheads">
          <div></div>
          <div><b>CAC</b><small>vs. prior 30 days</small></div>
          <div><b>ROAS</b><small>vs. prior 30 days</small></div>
          <div class="ch-trend">90 DAY TREND</div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-row">
          <div class="opclient">
            <div class="av a1" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 3.5l6 6-11 11-6-6 11-11z M5 13l6 6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><div class="nm">GLP-1 Brand</div><div class="cat">Subscription</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>$86.90</span> <span class="delta down" data-count>↓ 22%</span></div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>2.1×</span> <span class="delta up" data-count>↑ 18%</span></div>
          <div class="spark">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="drawline" d="M0,17 L4,15 L8,19 L12,16 L16,18 L20,15 L24,17 L28,19 L32,16 L36,18 L40,15 L44,17 L48,14 L52,17 L56,13 L60,15 L64,12 L68,14 L72,11 L76,13 L80,10 L84,12 L88,8 L92,11 L96,7 L100,9 L104,6 L108,8 L112,5 L116,7 L120,5" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-row">
          <div class="opclient">
            <div class="av a2" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><div class="nm">Telehealth Brand</div><div class="cat">Patient Acquisition</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>$32.10</span> <span class="delta down" data-count>↓ 21%</span></div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>1.7×</span> <span class="delta up" data-count>↑ 17%</span></div>
          <div class="spark">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="drawline" d="M0,22 L4,24 L8,21 L12,23 L16,20 L20,18 L24,22 L28,19 L32,21 L36,17 L40,15 L44,18 L48,13 L52,15 L56,11 L60,13 L64,16 L68,12 L72,9 L76,11 L80,14 L84,10 L88,7 L92,9 L96,12 L100,8 L104,5 L108,7 L112,9 L116,5 L120,7" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-row">
          <div class="opclient">
            <div class="av a3" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M12 3.5C9 8 6.5 11.5 6.5 14.5a5.5 5.5 0 0011 0c0-3-2.5-6.5-5.5-11z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><div class="nm">Supplement Brand</div><div class="cat">DTC</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>$18.90</span> <span class="delta down" data-count>↓ 28%</span></div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>2.3×</span> <span class="delta up" data-count>↑ 31%</span></div>
          <div class="spark">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="drawline" d="M0,18 L4,16 L8,18 L12,14 L16,16 L20,13 L24,15 L28,17 L32,19 L36,21 L40,20 L44,22 L48,19 L52,17 L56,14 L60,16 L64,12 L68,10 L72,12 L76,8 L80,10 L84,6 L88,8 L92,5 L96,7 L100,4 L104,6 L108,3 L112,5 L116,3 L120,3" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-row">
          <div class="opclient">
            <div class="av a4" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="7" y="3" width="10" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.2" r=".9" fill="#fff" stroke="none"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><div class="nm">Health App</div><div class="cat">Mobile</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>$1.85</span> <span class="delta down" data-count>↓ 34%</span></div>
          <div class="met"><span data-count>5.3×</span> <span class="delta up" data-count>↑ 42%</span></div>
          <div class="spark">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 36" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="drawline" d="M0,28 L4,30 L8,27 L12,29 L16,28 L20,30 L24,27 L28,29 L32,26 L36,28 L40,25 L44,27 L48,24 L52,22 L56,19 L60,16 L64,12 L68,15 L72,9 L76,7 L80,10 L84,5 L88,7 L92,3 L96,5 L100,2 L104,4 L108,2 L112,3 L116,1 L120,2" stroke="#0057ff" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ops-stats">
          <div class="ops-stat">
            <span class="ico ico--accent">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 21a7 7 0 0114 0M12 12a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="kv"><span class="v" data-count>71+</span><span class="l">Founders served</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ops-stat">
            <span class="ico ico--ok">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3v18M16 7H10a3 3 0 100 6h4a3 3 0 110 6H8"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="kv"><span class="v" data-count>$12.4M+</span><span class="l">Tracked revenue this quarter</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ops-stat">
            <span class="ico ico--violet">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 21a7 7 0 0114 0M12 12a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8zM18 4l3 3-3 3M21 7h-6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="kv"><span class="v" data-count>22%</span><span class="l">Avg. increase in returning customer rate</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- TRUST: right under the hero, in the first viewport on some screens, so no reveal -->
<section class="trust">
  <div class="container trust-inner">
    <div class="trust-label">
      <div class="big">Trusted by <b>71+ health founders</b></div>
      <div class="sub">FROM PRE-SEED TO PRE-BACKED</div>
    </div>
    <div class="marquee-wrap">
      <div class="marquee" id="marquee">
        <span class="logo" data-tall><img src="/logos/adidas.webp" alt="adidas" width="136" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo"><img src="/logos/jnj.webp" alt="Johnson &amp; Johnson" width="307" height="80" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo"><img src="/logos/alveos.webp" alt="alveos" width="290" height="70" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo logo-tile"><img src="/logos/liv.webp" alt="Liv" width="75" height="90" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo"><img src="/logos/fitbiomics.webp" alt="FITBIOMICS" width="430" height="70" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo"><img src="/logos/nectar.webp" alt="Nectar" width="180" height="90" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="logo"><img src="/logos/undefined-health.webp" alt="Undefined Health" width="337" height="70" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREATIVE STRIP -->
<section class="creative-strip" data-tone="tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="strip-head reveal">
      <h2>Creative built for the <span class="serif">scroll</span>, and the rules of every health platform.</h2>
      <div class="right">2,400+ <a class="tlink" href="/services/creative/">static & motion creatives</a> shipped this year. Every asset reviewed against Meta, Google & TikTok health policies before launch.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phone-rail-wrap reveal d1">
    <div class="phone-rail" id="phoneRail">
      {[...ADS, ...ADS].map((ad) => (
        <div class="ph"><div class="scr"><span class="notch"></span><div class="ad" data-ad={ad}></div></div></div>
      ))}
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BENTO -->
<section id="why" class="bento">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>WHY PARTNERS LOVE US</span>
      <h2>Built for health brands. <span class="serif">Designed to scale.</span></h2>
      <p>Five things every founder gets from our healthcare marketing services on day one, and the reason our partners average <b>24% lower CAC</b> in the first 30 days.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- B1 specialized -->
      <div class="bcard b1 reveal">
        <span class="tag">01 · SPECIALIZED</span>
        <div class="vis">
          <a class="cat" href="/industries/glp-1-weight-loss/"><span class="ico i-blue">G</span>GLP-1 & weight care<span class="meta">12 brands</span></a>
          <span class="cat"><span class="ico i-green">S</span>Supplements & DTC<span class="meta">22 brands</span></span>
          <span class="cat"><span class="ico i-amber">A</span>Health apps<span class="meta">8 brands</span></span>
          <span class="cat"><span class="ico i-violet">M</span>Mental health<span class="meta">6 brands</span></span>
          <span class="cat"><span class="ico i-cyan">F</span>Fitness & recovery<span class="meta">9 brands</span></span>
          <span class="cat cat-more"><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">+</span>And 6 more<span class="meta">verticals</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>The only categories we work in are the ones we've already scaled.</h3>
          <p>We’re a health and wellness marketing agency, and we don’t work outside health: telehealth marketing, GLP-1 and supplements are all we do. That’s why we know every Meta health policy by heart, and why we ship faster than a generalist agency ever could. Shortlisting? <a class="tlink" href="/blog/best-glp1-marketing-agencies-2026/">Compare GLP-1 marketing agencies</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B2 senior partner -->
      <div class="bcard b2 reveal d1">
        <span class="tag">02 · YOUR TEAM</span>
        <div class="vis">
          <div class="partner">
            <div class="top">
              <div class="pv">PA</div>
              <div><div class="who">Pira Ahilan</div><div class="role">CO-FOUNDER</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="msg">New angle live tonight, should pull CAC under $38 by Friday ✦</div>
            <div class="status"><span class="pulse"></span>Replies in 12m on avg.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>A senior growth partner, not a junior pod.</h3>
          <p>Paired with strategists who have scaled health brands past $20M.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B3 compliance -->
      <div class="bcard b3 reveal d2">
        <span class="tag">03 · COMPLIANT</span>
        <div class="vis">
          <div class="shield-wrap">
            <div class="ch-rules left">
              <span class="r">GLP-1 claims</span>
              <span class="r">Before/after</span>
              <span class="r">Rx language</span>
            </div>
            <div class="shield">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l4.5 4.5L19 7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ch-rules right">
              <span class="r">HIPAA-aware</span>
              <span class="r">FDA-safe copy</span>
              <span class="r">FTC review</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Compliance-first creative.</h3>
          <p>Pre-approved against health-vertical policies, so launches don’t get yanked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B4 creative engine -->
      <div class="bcard b4 reveal d1">
        <div class="body">
          <span class="tag">04 · CREATIVE ENGINE</span>
          <h3>20+ new creatives shipped every month.</h3>
          <p>Static, motion, and UGC, produced in-house, tested against an indexed library of winning angles, then scaled to the highest performers.</p>
          <div class="b4-stats">
            <div><div class="mono b4-k">CREATIVES SHIPPED · ALL-TIME</div><div class="b4-v">8,416</div></div>
            <div><div class="mono b4-k">WIN RATE</div><div class="b4-v">38%</div></div>
            <div><div class="mono b4-k">UGC CREATORS</div><div class="b4-v">140+</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="vis">
          {ADS.map((ad) => <div class="tile" data-ad={ad}></div>)}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B5 compounding system -->
      <div class="bcard b5 reveal">
        <span class="tag">05 · COMPOUNDING</span>
        <div class="vis">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 220" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g5" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0057ff" stop-opacity=".24"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0057ff" stop-opacity="0"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <filter id="b5shadow" x="-10%" y="-30%" width="120%" height="170%">
                <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#0a0a0f" flood-opacity="0.08"/>
              </filter>
            </defs>
            <g stroke="#e5e7ee" stroke-width=".7">
              <line x1="0" x2="600" y1="50" y2="50"/>
              <line x1="0" x2="600" y1="100" y2="100"/>
              <line x1="0" x2="600" y1="150" y2="150"/>
            </g>
            <path id="b5Line" class="drawline" d="M0,178 C60,170 120,166 180,158 S300,128 375,102 480,52 600,22" fill="none" stroke="#0057ff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M0,178 C60,170 120,166 180,158 S300,128 375,102 480,52 600,22 L600,220 L0,220 Z" fill="url(#g5)"/>
            <circle cx="375" cy="102" r="4.5" fill="#0057ff" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <g transform="translate(388 78)">
              <rect width="120" height="30" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7ee" filter="url(#b5shadow)"/>
              <text x="12" y="13" font-family="Geist Mono" font-size="9" fill="#6b6f7a" letter-spacing="0.5">DAY 31</text>
              <text x="12" y="25" font-family="Geist" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#0a0a0f">$182k tracked</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>A system that compounds while you sleep.</h3>
          <p>Tested creative library, optimized landers, and clean attribution, all working in lockstep, week after week.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B6 conversion lift -->
      <div class="bcard b6 reveal d1">
        <span class="tag">06 · CONVERSION</span>
        <div class="vis">
          <div class="meter" data-meter={METER}>
